{
  "name": "illegal-carrier",
  "purpose": "The identity-only session_info_update is the only legal carrier. Every other sessionUpdate variant is ineligible, and a tool-call entity patch is the sharpest case: its metadata is per-entity state a conformant client may legally collapse to the last value it saw, so an envelope placed there is unrecoverable and the notification is refused.",
